  "title": "Synthesis and Structure of the Polymetallic Yttrium Alkoxide Complex Y3(μ3-OCMe3)(μ3-Cl)(μ-OCMe3)3(OCMe3)4(THF)2 and Related Complexes: Ln3(μ3-OR)(μ3-X)(μ-OR)3 Building Blocks in Yttrium and Lanthanide Alkoxide Chemistry",
