        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "In a glovebox, LiOCMe3 (0.867 g, 11 mmol) in 12 mL of THF was added by pipet to YCl3 (1.057 g, 5.4 mmol) stirring in 10 mL of THF. The mixture was stirred 3 days at 29 °C, centrifuged, and the solution decanted from a pasty solid. Rotary evaporation left an oily residue that was extracted with toluene, centrifuged, and evaporated. The resulting oil was extracted with hexane; removal of solvent left a colorless solid. Crystalline 3 was isolated in low yield from a concentrated hexane solution; once isolated the crystals were insoluble even in THF.",
